g":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.5.rc2\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.rc2 - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8108) - AMD Ryzen 7 7745HX with Radeon Graphics (16 threads) - 63.18 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWith debug/gdscript/warnings/return_value_discarded set to warning or error, using a function call as the pattern guard in a match statement triggers the warning.\nFor example\n```gdscript\nextends Node\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n    match name:\n        \"Node\" when is_inside_tree(): # (RETURN_VALUE_DISCARDED): The function \"is_inside_tree()\" returns a value that will be discarded if not used.\n            pass\n```\nIdeally a pattern guard should consume the return value and not raise a warning or error.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nTake the match statement in the previous code snippet and add it to any function in any project\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[example.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22310873/example.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"U